{"type":"FlowTopic","triggers":[{"type":"Trigger","name":"04ba3ff6e5434d218415d51233dd8686","triggerType":"request","applicability":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"script","value":"true"},"id":"04ba3ff6e5434d218415d51233dd8686"}],"goals":[{"name":"primary","trigger_id":"04ba3ff6e5434d218415d51233dd8686","nodes":[{"type":"StartGoal","goal_id":"primary","greeting_msg":{"type":"String","mode":"string","value":""},"id":"d93fd5536a214959ad54393aacc51dc9","name":"Start","expert_mode":false},{"type":"TerminateGoal","goal_id":"primary","confirmation_msg":{"type":"String","mode":"string","value":""},"id":"b1513b274e2144f7a069773f647d812f","name":"End","expert_mode":false},{"type":"ScriptedAction","script":"(function execute() {

 vaVars.user_badge_count = 0;
 var identityId = vaInputs.user_sys_id; 
 var badgeAction = "replace" //
 //TODO - DO not replace mobile creds
 var baseURL = gs.getProperty('glide.servlet.uri');
 var images = {};
 images['PERMANENT_BADGE'] = baseURL + '/x_aleen_aia_skills.permanentbadge.png';
 images['TEMP_BADGE'] = baseURL + '/x_aleen_aia_skills.visitorbadge.png';
 images['MOBILE_CREDENTIAL'] = baseURL + '/x_aleen_aia_skills.digitalbadge.png';

 var badgeArray = [];
 var badgeGr = new GlideRecordSecure('x_aleen_snguardian_identity_asset'); 
 badgeGr.addQuery('identity', identityId);
 badgeGr.addNotNullQuery('status');
 badgeGr.addQuery('status.code', 'ACTIVE');
 badgeGr.addQuery('is_deleted',false);
 badgeGr.addQuery('asset.type.code','!=','MOBILE_CREDENTIAL');
 badgeGr.query();
 while (badgeGr.next()) {
 badgeArray.push({
 'name': badgeGr.getDisplayValue("asset.serial")+"("+badgeGr.getDisplayValue("identifier") +")",
 'value':badgeGr.getValue("sys_id"),
 'description':badgeGr.getDisplayValue("identity.full_name") +" - " +badgeGr.getDisplayValue("valid_to")+" - " +badgeGr.getDisplayValue("status.name"),
 'body': images[badgeGr.getDisplayValue("asset.type.code")]
 });
 }
 vaVars.user_badges_list = JSON.stringify(badgeArray);
 if(badgeArray.length >0){
 vaVars.user_badge_count = badgeArray.length;
 }
})();","id":"f1762558ad1c41c8992f1f3fa36e8afa","name":"Get User Active Badges","goal_id":"primary","applicability":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"script","value":"true"},"expert_mode":false},{"type":"Decision","name":"Active Badges Found?","branches":[{"type":"Branch","label":"Found","expression":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"script","value":"(function() { return (function execute() {
 var condition = vaVars.user_badge_count>0 ? true : false;
 return condition;
})()
})()"},"id":"58ebf43c7c0d4c6e9f7ae638df929a62","name":"Found","expert_mode":false},{"type":"Branch","label":"Not Found","expression":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"script","value":"(function() { return (function execute() {
 var condition = vaVars.user_badge_count== 0 ? true : false;
 return condition;
})()
})()"},"id":"71f51eaf1db645dda9da2c0b939a97da","name":"Not Found","expert_mode":false}],"id":"57f7cf8c85964cf0a88fcfadeb5834e0","goal_id":"primary","expert_mode":false},{"type":"LibraryCall","library_topic_name":"Data Collector","library_topic_id":"4c19933e4322211006650464dbb8f22d","library_topic_is_template":false,"parameter-mappings":[{"parameter-name":"definition","value":{"type":"String","mode":"script","value":"(function execute() {
 var config = {
 configuration: {"purpose":"{{0}}","inputs":[{"name":"display_user_active_badges","type":"carousel","discoverable":true,"description":"Ask user to select one of displayed badges to take further action \nASK ONE LINE QUESTION as Please select badge to be replaced.","skipMode":"'simple'","skipCondition":"\"\"","helpText":"false","script":"(function(vaVars, vaInputs) {return (function execute() {\n var options = [];\n var items = JSON.parse(vaVars.user_badges_list|| '[]');\n if (items.length === 0) {\n options.push({\n name: 'No Badge',\n value: 'none',\n description: 'No badge found',\n body: 'https://somehost/somepath/somepic1.jpg'\n });\n } else {\n items.forEach(function(it) {\n options.push({\n name: it.name || '',\n value: it.value || '',\n description: it.description || '',\n body: it.body || ''\n });\n });\n }\nreturn options;\n})();\n;})(_taskVaVars[{{4}}], _taskVaInputs[{{5}}])","applicability":"","validation":""},{"name":"ask_reason","type":"choice","discoverable":true,"description":"Ask user the reason for replacement of badge as \nPlease select reason for replacement of selected badge.","skipMode":"'simple'","skipCondition":"\"\"","helpText":"false","choices":[{"value":"lost","label":"Lost"},{"value":"stolen","label":"Stolen"}],"applicability":"","validation":""}],"instructions":"{{1}}","advanced_parameters":"{{2}}","callingTask":"{{3}}","confirm_summary":false,"slots":[{"name":"badge_valid_from","type":"date_time","discoverable":true,"description":"Ask user to select valid from date\n","validation":"","format":"date_time"},{"name":"badge_valid_to","type":"date_time","discoverable":true,"description":"Ask user to select valid to date\n","validation":"","format":"date_time"},{"name":"enter_badge_serial_number","type":"string","discoverable":true,"description":"Enter Badge Serial Number","validation":"(function(vaVars, vaInputs) {return function validate(value) {\n var isValid = value.length>=3?true:false;\n return {\n valid: isValid,\n error: isValid ? undefined : \"Badge Serial must be of at least 3 digit\"\n }\n}\n;})(_taskVaVars[{{6}}], _taskVaInputs[{{7}}])"}],"applicability":"","classificationOverrides":[]}
 };
 return JSON.stringify(config);
 })()"},"metadata":{"type":"String","list":false,"items":[],"use_items":false}},{"parameter-name":"inputs","metadata":{"type":"String","list":true,"items":[{"type":"String","mode":"string","value":""},{"type":"String","mode":"string","value":""},{"type":"String","mode":"string","value":""},{"type":"String","mode":"script","value":"(function() { return vaSystem.getConversationTaskId()})()"},{"type":"String","mode":"script","value":"(function() { return JSON.stringify(vaSystem.getConversationTaskId())})()"},{"type":"String","mode":"script","value":"(function() { return JSON.stringify(vaSystem.getConversationTaskId())})()"},{"type":"String","mode":"script","value":"(function() { return JSON.stringify(vaSystem.getConversationTaskId())})()"},{"type":"String","mode":"script","value":"(function() { return JSON.stringify(vaSystem.getConversationTaskId())})()"}],"use_items":true}}],"return-value-mappings":[{"main_topic_variable_namespace":"vaInputs","library_topic_return_parameter_name":"outputs","main_topic_mapped_variable_name":"ai_data_collector_b411940e662b430286405ddff35e30f2_output"}],"header_card_fields":[],"input_parameters_mode":"dynamic","output_parameters_mode":"dynamic","id":"b411940e662b430286405ddff35e30f2","name":"Display User Active Badges","goal_id":"primary","expert_mode":false,"variableIds":["a31136ca77c44916979c3d9cd3b81a40","8e591118a6ac4084afc2e68137e89f34"]},{"type":"ScriptedAction","script":"(function execute() {
 //GETTING USER LOCATION , USER TYPE
 var idenlocationGr = new GlideRecordSecure('x_aleen_snguardian_identity_location')
 idenlocationGr.addQuery('identity',vaInputs.user_sys_id);
 idenlocationGr.query();
 var location = "";
 if(idenlocationGr.next()){
 location = idenlocationGr.location;
 vaVars.user_location = location;
 vaVars.user_type = idenlocationGr.identity.type;
 }

 //BADGE TYPE BASED ON SELECTED BADGE 
 vaVars.badge_to_replace = vaInputs.display_user_active_badges;
 var idenAssetGr = new GlideRecordSecure('x_aleen_snguardian_identity_asset');
 idenAssetGr.addQuery('sys_id',vaVars.badge_to_replace);
 idenAssetGr.query();
 if(idenAssetGr.next()){
 vaVars.badge_type = idenAssetGr.getDisplayValue('asset.type.code'); //asset type code
 vaVars.badge_system = idenAssetGr.asset.system // system sys_id
 }

 vaVars.badge_action = "replace"
 var inputs = {};
 inputs['u_location'] = vaVars.user_location; // Reference, Sys ID of the record 
 inputs['u_employee_type'] = vaVars.user_type; // Reference, Sys ID of the record 
 inputs['u_badge_type'] = vaVars.badge_type; // String 
 inputs['u_badge_action'] = vaVars.badge_action; // String 

 var dt = new sn_dt.DecisionTableAPI();
 var response = dt.getDecision('0d37c78833843650bf1221382e5c7bc7', inputs);

 var result_elements = response.result_elements;
 vaVars.dt_res_u_auto_badge_allocation = result_elements.u_auto_badge_allocation.getValue(); // True/False
 vaVars.dt_res_u_create_request = result_elements.u_create_request.getValue(); // True/False
 vaVars.dt_res_u_def_valid_from = result_elements.u_def_valid_from.getValue(); // True/False
 vaVars.dt_res_u_def_valid_to = result_elements.u_def_valid_to.getValue(); // Duration
 vaVars.dt_res_u_def_access = result_elements.u_def_access.getValue(); // True/False
 vaVars.dt_res_u_copy_access = result_elements.u_copy_access.getValue() ; //True/False
 vaVars.dt_res_u_deactivate_old_badge = result_elements.u_deactivate_old_badge.getValue(); //True/False

 vaVars.new_asset_id = ""; 
 if(vaVars.dt_res_u_auto_badge_allocation == "1" || vaVars.dt_res_u_auto_badge_allocation == 1){
 var assetGr = new GlideRecordSecure('x_aleen_snguardian_asset');
 assetGr.addQuery('type.code',vaVars.badge_type); 
 assetGr.addQuery('system',vaVars.badge_system); 
 assetGr.addQuery('status.code',"UNASSIGNED");
 assetGr.query();
 if(assetGr.next()){
 vaVars.new_asset_id = assetGr.getUniqueValue(); 
 }
 }

 if(vaVars.dt_res_u_def_valid_from == "1"){
 vaVars.badge_valid_from_cal = new GlideDateTime().getDisplayValue();
 }else{
 vaVars.badge_valid_from_cal = "";
 }

 if("1970-01-01 00:00:00" != vaVars.dt_res_u_def_valid_to && "" != vaVars.dt_res_u_def_valid_to){
 vaVars.badge_valid_to_calc = new x_aleen_snguardian.TimeZoneUtil().getDurationDifference(vaVars.dt_res_u_def_valid_to, "add");
 }else{
 vaVars.badge_valid_to_calc = "";
 }

 //ASK USER INPUT :: IF MANUAL, valid from ==0 , valid to ==0
 if( vaVars.dt_res_u_create_request == "0"){
 vaVars.submission_mode = "direct";
 }else{
 // vaVars.submission_mode = "request";
 vaVars.submission_mode = "direct";
 }

})()
